WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:44.250
Front-line preparations were complete
for a major Gi offensive.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:48.000
The Hi Shin Unit stood
at the front of the main army,

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.750
led by commanding general Mou Gou,

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:54.700
and Shin waited impatiently
for the battle to begin,

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:57.580
to rack up more victories and get ever closer

00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:00.910
to becoming one of the
world's greatest generals!

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:04.160
Meanwhile, in the capital Kanyou,

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:08.080
Sei asked his mother,
the Queen Dowager, for her assistance.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:10.830
In its public response,
the Inner Palace sent over

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.910
the heads of their three royal patron families.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:18.370
Yet in private, the Queen Dowager was colluding

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:22.660
with Sei's archenemy Ryo Fui
in a plot to betray the King.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:27.790
Court lady Kou just happened
to witness their meeting

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:31.830
and was gravely wounded
at the hands of a eunuch bodyguard.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:41.180
"The Lineup"

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.290
Take a route where we won't be seen.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.580
Yes, sir!

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.950
No one knows about this but you.

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:58.290
This goes without saying,
but do not tell another soul.

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:00.870
I-I understand, sir.

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:05.660
Dear me... I came to draw
upon the Inner Palace's power,

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.160
but to meet secretly with the
Queen Dowager there of all places,

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.000
where men are forbidden?

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:16.370
Perhaps I indulged a little
too much--if I do say so myself.

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:30.620
The Inner Palace physicians
kept Kou from losing too much blood,

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:33.500
but her high fever remained,
and on the second day,

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.910
she still hovered on the
border between life and death.

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:43.330
Kou... it's okay...

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.500
It's all going to be okay.

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:49.700
We've done all we can, You.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.950
Most likely, she only has until evening.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:04:01.370
The Queen Dowager's
personal physician may be of some help,

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:03.950
but far be it from us to ask for it.

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:07.500
Prepare yourself, You.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.910
N-No...

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:21.870
It can't be... Kou...

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.080
...ness...

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:40.250
H-His... H-High... ness...

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.830
Kou!

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:47.750
His... H-High... n-ness...

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:51.540
His High... ness...

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:52.830
Kou...

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.620
I'm sorry, Haku Shun...

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:21.120
I am not Haku Shun. I'm You.

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:25.660
I-I have sidelined a court lady
most vital to the Kingdom,

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:30.870
which I fully understand is
a greater offense than any other.

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:37.500
A-and for which crime I...
I willingly accept any punishment.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:42.160
Just... please, Your Highness... please...

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:44.950
Please help Kou!

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:47.200
Otherwise, she will surely die!

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:52.370
Kou has gotten tangled up in something

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:54.870
and has been stabbed in the stomach.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:59.910
She's been unconscious for hours now...
but the entire time,

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:01.540
she's been calling for Your Highness.

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:07.370
I know my request is an unreasonable one,

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:15.410
But please... please help Kou.
Please save her.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.660
Kou has spoken of you from time to time.

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:26.950
This unconventional course of action
fits with what I've heard.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:34.620
Wake Kyou Rei and her team
of physicians! I'll explain later!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:35.620
Sire!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.660
Dry your tears, You.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.500
We're going to help Kou.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:48.500
Stay with us, Kou!

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:49.500
Kou!

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:54.750
It's amazing that she's still alive at all.

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:56.950
Where'd that You run off to, anyway?

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.330
You! Where on earth have you--

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:05.790
Y-Your Highness!

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:10.160
You may leave the rest to us.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.830
The medical team Sei
brought with him were experts

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.080
in every field of ancient
Middle Kingdom medicine.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:24.330
They tended to Kou with the best
of all the medical skills they had.

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:26.910
However...

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:34.830
How... how is Kou doing?

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:37.370
She is alive for now,

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:41.830
but still straddles the border
between our world and the next.

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:45.330
It's best for her to sleep now,

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:49.620
but no matter how much
medicated vapor we use, nothing takes.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:50.830
Why not?

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:54.450
There is something she simply
must tell Your Highness...

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:59.580
and her will is great enough
to resist the effect of any drug.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.750
Please, hear her out.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:05.160
If she does not sleep soon,
her life will be in danger.

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.620
Y-Your Highness...

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:28.910
You've done well, Kou.

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:33.870
What happened?

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.580
You had something to tell me?

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.200
Quickly, now, or your health may suffer.

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:52.370
I-I am deeply sorry that I must
deliver such difficult news.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:05.290
The Queen Dowager and Minister Ryo Fui...

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.540
...are secretly together!

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:08.540
What?!

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:15.250
The Inner Palace's offer...
to be Your Highness's ally...

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.410
...was a lie.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.750
And that's not all.

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:25.700
Before Your Highness was born,

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:27.790
the two of them were betrothed...

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:33.370
And last night, the
Queen Dowager and the Minister...

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:36.450
most likely spent the night with one another.

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:44.700
Forgive me... for this news...

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:47.700
I thought it important...

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:52.450
Please, Your Highness... I beg forgiveness...

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:58.660
You have done well to tell me, Kou.

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:04.660
You may very well have saved my life.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:05.790
You have my thanks.

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:11.040
I'm happy... to have been of assistance...

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:16.000
Now... I can sleep... at last...

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:22.450
I have been... so tired... for so long...

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.080
Mother and Ryo Fui...

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:57.410
What's she driving at,
taking Ryo Fui as her companion?!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:00.660
The two of them--betrothed?

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:07.450
So all of this odd behavior
was just to draw out Ryo Fui...

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:11.040
And her meeting with me
was likely to make doubly sure

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.790
she had no maternal feelings.

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:18.000
No. I'm hardly surprised at this point.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:21.830
You have always been like that, Mother.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:25.540
You haven't changed one bit
ever since I was born...

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:26.790
You <i>can't</i> change.

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:31.700
You're still in that darkness...

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:39.370
<i>I</i> changed when I left Kantan.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:43.790
I have allies in whom
I place my unhesitating trust.

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:51.160
Your antics will not shake me--not now.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:55.790
Ryo Fui...

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:59.200
you've just made a huge misstep!

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:05.030
"Ei Sei"

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.160
Meanwhile,

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:12.580
as the Chin army approached
the first castle, Gaolang,

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:15.870
General Mou Gou began
readying his troops for war.

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:21.750
First they would divide into four
to attack the castle from all sides.

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:25.120
Each team would have its own reserves.

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:28.450
These reserves would serve
as floating reinforcements,

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:31.830
and could be called upon to
clinch the fight for Chin as needed.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:35.160
The Hi Shin Unit wound up
in the front of those reserves,

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:38.040
right where they wanted to be,

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:41.040
but Ou Hon's Gyoku Hou Force
was even further forward,

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:43.620
having nabbed the coveted front line.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:49.910
Thus the reserves' highest hopes
were pinned on the Gyoku Hou Force.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:54.450
Dammit! Of <i>course</i> they'd be ahead of us!

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:57.540
And they're a cavalry.
We'll never be able to keep up with 'em

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.870
when it counts most!

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:06.410
Things sure are getting heated over here, huh?

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:10.250
Lighten up, would you?
We're in this for the long haul.

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:17.200
What's with him?

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:23.410
Oh, sorry! I didn't even introduce
myself--and I'm all the way up here.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:29.450
I'm actually the commander
of a 300-man squad myself.

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:32.830
The Gaku Ka Force. Know it?

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.080
The Gaku Ka Force?

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:39.410
Lieutenant En, isn't the Gaku Ka Force...

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:40.870
Yes.

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:47.120
The 300-man squad that scored
front-line victories just south of us.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:50.910
Their leader is rumored to be capable
of commanding a thousand--

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:54.580
though he's no older than Shin.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.370
The Gaku Ka Force?

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:59.580
Never heard of it. Who are you,
and what's with that getup?

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:03.910
Mou Ten, sir!

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:08.000
What are you doing over there?!

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:09.790
Hey, Pops!

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:10.950
Mou Ten?

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:17.160
Look, Pops--it's the Hi Shin Unit.
I was just saying hello.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.250
Right?

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:23.950
A fellow 300-man squad in the
same position of the same reserves!

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:26.370
I thought us commanders should get together.

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:29.330
But... we're bringing up the reserves' rear.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:32.000
We're not in the same position at all!

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:33.000
Huh?

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:36.870
Some 300-man squad commander he is!

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.790
The rumors were way off!

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:43.160
Well, anyway... I'm Mou Ten.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:44.160
Nice to meet you.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.540
And with that... good day!

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:02.830
Wait!

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:07.120
Who the hell <i>are</i> you?

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.660
I told you: Mou Ten of the Gaku Ka Force.

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:16.700
Oh, I know! I have a better introduction,
one you'll understand.

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:21.790
Just like you and Ou Hon,

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:24.330
I'm striving to be one of the
world's greatest generals!

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:28.620
Him, too?

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:39.200
Who's he think he is, talkin' like Shin?

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:42.000
Is he seriously the head of the Gaku Ka Force?

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.330
Are they gonna be okay?

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:49.950
He's pretty good.

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:52.620
Yeah... I know.

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:55.790
Mou Ten... better remember that name.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:15:59.790
Mou Ten, sir?

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:07.200
I misunderstood! You're aiming to be
one of the world's greatest generals?

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:11.410
Why, that... that warms the
very cockles of my heart!

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.660
That was a joke. Sorry.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:20.450
Huh?

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:23.580
I just thought it'd be funny at the time.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:24.370
<i>What</i> ?!

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:26.830
Heck, I'd be happy as a civil servant.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:28.080
Wha-a-at?!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:33.330
Thus, whether by chance
or by the general's design,

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:36.500
three great 300-man squads
in their prime were placed together

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:41.120
in Chin's eastern army reserves:

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:43.450
Ou Hon of the Gyoku Hou Force,

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:45.540
Shin of the Hi Shin Unit,

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:47.290
and Mou Ten of the Gaku Ka Force.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:52.200
All three, though young, were well experienced.

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.950
These three groups, bursting with personality,

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:58.830
would soon be the talk of the whole Chin army.

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:03.450
Yet none of these young men cared one bit.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:09.410
All they wanted now was to
distinguish themselves in battle.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.290
Oh, it's you.

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.450
Hey. What's up?

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:55.120
Tending to Ryo Kusui.
And what are <i>you</i> doing at this hour?

00:17:55.120 --> 00:18:01.410
We'll finally reach Gaolang tomorrow.
Feels like I got hot coals burnin' in me.

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:04.250
Just like always.

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:09.040
Well, I wouldn't be myself without 'em!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:12.250
Hey--whaddya say to a quick spar?

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:32.910
Catch me off guard again
and I'll run you through.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.950
Sorry, sorry!

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:55.080
The new day dawned,

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:58.500
embracing the young soldiers' myriad thoughts.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.200
Right.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:28.410
I've finally set things
a little straighter in my head...

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:34.830
I'll use this expedition to take care
of some unfinished business.

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:38.290
I shall have revenge by my own hand!

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:40.620
And that's enough.

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:54.790
That day, the 80-thousand-man Chin army

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:58.620
finally arrived at Gaolang, Gi's first castle,

00:19:58.620 --> 00:20:00.290
and surrounded it.

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:04.660
Mou Gou, sir!

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:07.450
"Ra Gen, General of Chin"

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:08.310
Isn't the enemy being a little <i>too</i> quiet?

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:10.330
Probably quaking in fear
of an army that's 80 thousand strong!

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:13.870
When we <i>can</i> move, Mou Gou, sir,
we should all move together.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:22.450
Charge!

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:44.160
Report!

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:47.450
Large numbers of casualties
at the west and south walls!

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:49.700
The north wall has almost fallen!

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:51.620
Then send reserves to the north!

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:53.870
Wait! What about the east?

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:56.700
The east is losing little strength,

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:59.160
but the tide of battle there keeps changing!

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:02.410
Use the north as a decoy
to focus enemy strength,

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:06.290
then send in reserves to attack
the east wall in one fell swoop.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:09.200
The eastern reserves
have some exceptional talent.

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:12.950
But there's something about the east wall...

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.290
Something...?

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:19.250
Yes, I can feel it...

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:21.660
Then let's get a better read on the situation--

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:25.830
No. If we're right,
all the more reason to move onward.

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:27.910
This is a war of attrition.

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:32.000
Best to make the enemy tip their hand early on.

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:39.750
Storm the east wall!

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:43.370
Reserves, mobilize at once!

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:45.830
Storm the east wall!

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:48.290
Reserves, mobilize at once!

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:51.410
Yesss! Finally, our turn to shine!

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:53.160
Let's go, Hi Shin Unit!

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:26.120
Wh-What the hell is this?!

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:36.250
From down here,
I can tell they're crazy powerful...

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:41.040
How are we supposed
to storm somethin' like <i>this</i> ?

00:22:42.700 --> 00:22:45.830
General, isn't it about that time?

00:22:45.830 --> 00:22:50.830
Hmph! Those Chin idiots.
We've got them right where we want them.

00:22:51.870 --> 00:22:53.160
Fire!

00:22:54.950 --> 00:22:56.120
Wh--

00:22:56.120 --> 00:22:57.120
What the--?!

00:22:59.620 --> 00:23:01.870
What's with all these arrows?!

00:23:01.870 --> 00:23:05.410
There's a huge squad of archers
hiding behind the walls!

00:23:06.410 --> 00:23:07.870
I knew it.

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:10.370
Yep. A trap.

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:00.870 --> 00:25:07.020
"The Siege of Gao Lang Castle"
